OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall a day after
OL,4,Ablockbuster opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose falls continued into Friday, with
OL,7,Fthe tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite Index
OL,8,Fopening down 1.3%. The S&P 500 also
OL,9,Fopened down 0.4% while the Dow Jones
OL,10,FIndustrial Average opened slightly
OL,11,Fhigher.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
