OL,3,AWhite House removes cyber-security
OL,4,Achief after series of tech outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS officials said the outages were not
OL,7,Fcaused by cyberattacks but the
OL,8,Fblackouts had sparked scrutiny from
OL,9,Fmembers of Congress who demanded a
OL,10,Fclearer explanation of what went wrong.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
