OL,3,AGTA 6 drives spike in download demand,
OL,4,Aas estimated sales top $2.3bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrand Theft Auto 6 is estimated to be
OL,7,Fthe biggest entertainment launch in
OL,8,Fhistory after the blockbuster video
OL,9,Fgame debuted on Thursday, following a
OL,10,F13-year wait.
OL,12,FInternet infrastructure firm Cloudflare
OL,13,Fsaid PS5 downloads in the UK peaked at
OL,14,F8.6 times normal levels around its
OL,15,Flaunch. New Zealand, where GTA 6 was
OL,16,Ffirst available, saw a 14.8-fold spike
OL,17,Ffour hours before, suggesting some
OL,18,Fplayers switched regions for early
OL,19,Faccess.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
