OL,3,ANew Hunger Games cast say joining the
OL,4,Afranchise is 'nerve-racking'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's been 14 years since the release of
OL,7,Fthe first Hunger Games movie, which
OL,8,Fhelped establish the careers of
OL,9,Ftalented young actors Jennifer
OL,10,FLawrence, Josh Hutcherson, Tom Blyth
OL,11,Fand Rachel Zegler.
OL,13,FThis latest instalment, prequel film
OL,14,FSunrise on the Reaping, looks to do the
OL,15,Fsame with its leading trio: 21-year-old
OL,16,FJoseph Zada, 20-year-old Mckenna Grace
OL,17,Fand 23-year-old Whitney Peak.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795187901
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew Hunger Games cast say joining the
OL,4,Afranchise is 'nerve-racking'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSitting down with BBC News at the start
OL,7,Fof a gruelling press run, the group
OL,8,Fwere buzzing with a mixture of
OL,9,Fanticipation, nerves and excitement
OL,10,Fahead of the release of the
OL,11,Fmuch-talked-about film.
OL,13,FZada, who is taking on his first major
OL,14,Frole as lead Haymitch Abernathy, said
OL,15,Fthey had been "clinging together" and
OL,16,F"using each other, making sure we all
OL,17,Ffeel supported".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
