OL,16,Ffirst available, saw a 14.8-fold spike
OL,17,Ffour hours before, suggesting some
OL,18,Fplayers switched regions for early
OL,19,Faccess.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
