OL,3,ANext round of BBC cuts will be more
OL,4,Anoticeable to audiences, report warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther job losses and programme cuts
OL,7,Fat the BBC will be more noticeable to
OL,8,Faudiences than previous savings
OL,9,Fmeasures, a new report has warned.
OL,11,FThe corporation announced plans earlier
OL,12,Fthis year to cut about 1,800 roles and
OL,13,Fclose some programmes and services, but
OL,14,Fit has further savings to make to reach
OL,15,Fits #500m target.
OL,17,FIn its report, the National Audit
OL,18,FOffice (NAO) anticipated the BBC's next
OL,19,Fround of cost-cutting measures would be
OL,20,Fmore difficult to deliver and more
OL,21,Fperceptible to audiences.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
