OL,3,ANext round of BBC cuts will be more
OL,4,Anoticeable to audiences, report warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC welcomed the report, saying it
OL,7,Fhad "consistently argued that the
OL,8,Fcurrent funding model is not
OL,9,Fsustainable and needs reform".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
